    "%lld stacks" : {

    },
    "⌘1 through ⌘9 jump between areas. ⌘N is each area’s primary action — Run Container, Launch Stack, Pull an image, Create, or Log In — and ⇧⌘N launches a stack from Containers. ⌘R refreshes, ⌥⌘I toggles the inspector, and ⌘⌫ deletes the selection after a confirmation. In logs, ⌘F searches, ⌘G and ⇧⌘G step through matches, and ⇧⌘L opens a stack’s logs in their own window. ⌘, opens Settings and ⌘? opens this Help." : {

    },
