    "CLI version" : {

    },
    "Click + in Stacks (or ⌘N there) and pick a docker-compose.yml. Container Desktop creates the named volumes and a project network, builds services that declare build: — starting the builder automatically when needed — and starts everything in dependency order with live progress." : {

    },
    "Click the + (Run Container) button to choose an image and set ports, environment variables, volumes, and resources. Give it a Project name to group it with related containers." : {

    },
