    "Entrypoint" : {

    },
    "Environment" : {

    },
    "Every list — containers, images, networks, volumes, machines, and registry logins — supports multiple selection. Click an item, then ⌘-click to add others or ⇧-click to extend the range, and right-click to apply one action to all of them. The menu only shows actions that fit the selection, so you’ll see Stop only when something selected is running." : {

