    },
    "The stack inspector’s Logs tab merges every service’s output into one live view, each line prefixed with its service in a stable color. Click a chip to hide a service, Option-click to show only it, search with ⌘F, and open the whole thing in its own window with ⇧⌘L. Lines appear in arrival order — the runtime doesn’t timestamp them." : {

